1. Purpose
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The source code of this repository ("the Software") is published so that
customers, prospective customers and the public can see how Unpause works.
Publishing it is about transparency. It is not open source in the sense of the
Open Source Definition, and it does not grant the rights that open-source
licenses grant.

"The Software" means everything in this repository: source code, designs,
texts, images, data, documentation and every later version of them.

